# Work around exact-version shlibs metadata in upstream QCA v3.0.11 .deb.
# QCA v3.0.10 -> v3.0.11 only changed version detection and CI packaging;
# no sources or exported public headers changed. Keep the lowest compatible
# QCA runtime dependency while building against the installed v3.0.11.
# This override is intentionally used ONLY for QCA 3.0.11 by debian/rules.
libqca3-qt6 3 libqca3-qt6-3 (>= 3.0.10)
